cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this version of the code archive."
type: software
title: "Analysis code and data for \"Contact-dependent intercellular dTMP transfer sustains tumor cell proliferation\""
version: 1.0.5
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/paoloceppilab/dTMP-transfer"
abstract: "Analysis scripts and source data for the five bioinformatics Methods sections of Contact-dependent intercellular dTMP transfer sustains tumor cell proliferation: human A549 bulk RNA-seq differential expression analysis, single-cell classification analysis (GSE148071), Visium spatial neighborhood analysis, spatial deconvolution and cell-state co-abundance analysis using cell2location and NMF, and Kras/Trp53 amplicon gene-editing and mutation analysis. Each analysis folder records inputs, provenance and execution limits. MIT applies to laboratory-authored code; third-party code and scientific data retain their original terms."
